{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o170d","title":"邓艾任太尉钟会任司徒","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o170d-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"邓艾任太尉钟会任司徒","evidence":["shaodi-e-o170d-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-4-e15","label":"正文 · 十二月","text":"诏以邓艾为太尉增邑封二子","evidence":["wgc-q0392","wgc-q0053"]},{"id":"wgc-a-7-e7","label":"正文 · 十二月","text":"诏以钟会为司徒进封县侯","evidence":["wgc-q0482","wgc-q0483"]},{"id":"wgc-a-add075","label":"正文","text":"邓艾钟会持节都督如故，未受新命而死","evidence":["wgc-q0718"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0080","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o170d-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o170d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":263,"label":"乙卯","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o165","basis":"乙卯"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o170d-q","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o170d-q","source_order":[4,792,"O170d"],"order":1277}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0080","name":"邓艾","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o170d-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-96a8f5aeb2ad7da35c42","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，庚戌〖15〗，以司徒郑冲为太保。壬子〖16〗，分益州为梁州〖17〗。癸丑〖18〗，特赦益州士民，复除租赋之半，五年。乙卯〖19〗，以征西将军邓艾为太尉，镇西将军钟会为司徒。皇太后崩。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0053","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b7612844c61653ea74e6","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，诏曰：“艾曜威奋武，深入虏庭，斩将搴旗，枭其鲸鲵〖10〗；使僭号之主〖11〗，稽首系颈〖12〗，历世逋诛〖13〗，一朝而平。兵不逾时〖14〗，战不终日；云彻席卷，荡定巴蜀。虽白起破强楚〖15〗，韩信克劲赵，吴汉擒子阳〖16〗，亚夫灭七国〖17〗；计功论美，不足比勋也。其以艾为太尉，增邑二万户；封子二人亭侯，各食邑千户。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0392","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b7612844c61653ea74e6","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，诏曰：“艾曜威奋武，深入虏庭，斩将搴旗，枭其鲸鲵〖10〗；使僭号之主〖11〗，稽首系颈〖12〗，历世逋诛〖13〗，一朝而平。兵不逾时〖14〗，战不终日；云彻席卷，荡定巴蜀。虽白起破强楚〖15〗，韩信克劲赵，吴汉擒子阳〖16〗，亚夫灭七国〖17〗；计功论美，不足比勋也。其以艾为太尉，增邑二万户；封子二人亭侯，各食邑千户","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0482","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6c3b6d58b4e6ae75c229","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，诏曰：“会所向摧弊，前无强敌；缄制众城，网罗进逸。蜀之豪帅，面缚归命；谋无遗策，举无废功。凡所降诛，动以万计；全胜独克，有征无战。拓平西夏，方隅清晏。其以会为司徒，进封县侯，增邑万户；封子二人亭侯，邑各千户","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":534,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0483","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-6c3b6d58b4e6ae75c229","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，诏曰：“会所向摧弊，前无强敌；缄制众城，网罗进逸。蜀之豪帅，面缚归命；谋无遗策，举无废功。凡所降诛，动以万计；全胜独克，有征无战。拓平西夏，方隅清晏。其以会为司徒，进封县侯，增邑万户；封子二人亭侯，邑各千户。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":534,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0718","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-931d6e16b2fb764e26f9","layer":"original","quote":"初，艾为太尉，会为司徒，皆持节、都督诸军如故；咸未受命而毙。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":594,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
